    {
      "name": "wizard_lookup_definitions",
      "description": "Search the company knowledge base: business definitions (sell-through, share, investment-efficiency proxy, observed switchers), fiscal calendar, markets and models, platform guides, and company notes on the organisation, products, processes and internal acronyms. Use it whenever a term, acronym, team, product or process matters to the answer. Returns the best-matching notes (long notes: the matching sections), each showing whether an owner has signed it and when an expert last confirmed it.",
      "inputSchema": {
